msgid ""
"Stop forcing verbose names into title case on forms and models. Drop the "
"bundled initial migration so the app ships migration-free with the current "
"registry."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Register field requirements as a self-contained contrib feature. Lead and "
"Opportunity opt in through the feature registry; models that cannot store an "
"empty value cannot be relaxed. Per-company FieldRequirement rows resolve "
"through get_field_requirements_for_model. Admins configure overrides on a "
"dedicated settings page. Opted-in create and edit forms pick up those "
"overrides through FormExtension discovery."
